# Backend API (`backend/`)

- Extend existing Fastify app in `src/app.ts`; public routes stay under `/v1`, admin under `/v1/admin`.
- Business logic lives in `src/services/**`, not in route handlers.
- Validate with Zod; share public DTOs via `@may-flower/shared`.
- Follow `BUSINESS_RULES.md` for stock, orders, and payments.
- Add Vitest tests using `buildApp()` and `app.inject()`.
- See `BACKEND_IMPLEMENTATION_ROADMAP.md` for phase order.
